<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Day 4 · 몬주익 · 항구</name>
    <description>언덕·미술관·항구를 잇는 여유 있는 하루. 케이블카 옵션 있음.</description>
    <Placemark>
      <name>1. 몬주익 성</name>
      <description>오전 · 90분
항구·시내 전망. 케이블카로 올라가도 좋음.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>2.1651,41.3633,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>2. 미로 미술관</name>
      <description>오전~점심 · 75분
취향이면 방문. 아니면 MNAC로 바로 이동.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>2.1598,41.3686,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>3. 카탈루냐 국립미술관 (MNAC)</name>
      <description>오후 · 90분
건물 계단 전망만 봐도 가치 있음.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>2.1535,41.3683,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>4. 스페인 광장 · 매직 분수</name>
      <description>저녁 · 45분
분수 쇼가 있으면 저녁에 맞춰 대기.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>2.1516,41.3711,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>5. 포트 벨</name>
      <description>밤 · 60분
항구 산책·저녁 식사. 마레마그눔 쪽.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>2.1778,41.3755,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Day 4 route</name>
      <Style>
        <LineStyle><color>ff2a6fdb</color><width>4</width></LineStyle>
      </Style>
      <LineString>
        <tessellate>1</tessellate>
        <coordinates>2.1651,41.3633,0 2.1598,41.3686,0 2.1535,41.3683,0 2.1516,41.3711,0 2.1778,41.3755,0</coordinates>
      </LineString>
    </Placemark>
  </Document>
